  "note": "animations: event -> animation. The engine notes cues (g.cues) when a power asks for one (\"cue\" in the action, or cueAmount/cueUid recorded by a stats action: statGranted); the interface plays the animation that the mod chose for the event."
 },
 "companion": {
  "note": "The companion card: handed to the player when a servant of \"type\" is recruited (once per game), it evolves during the game, does not count toward the hand limit, cannot be discarded or replaced and is lost for the game if it dies. Its name is nameFormat with {number} written in base numberBase on numberWidth digits; the number is the victories counted in the profile counter plus one.",
  "type": "nythe",
  "profileCounter": "prWins",
  "nameFormat": "PR-{number}",
  "numberBase": 16,
  "numberWidth": 3,
  "card": {
   "rank": 1,
   "atk": 2,
   "hp": 2,
   "types": [
    "nythe"
   ],
   "kw": [],
   "skill": [
    {
     "t": "passive",
     "fx": "companionPersists",
     "a": 0,
     "h": 0,
     "n": 0
    }
   ]
  }
 },
 "fusion": {
  "note": "Fusion: when the player has \"count\" identical servants (same name, none of them gold or fixed), board and hand together, they become one gold servant: the sum of their statistics, the sockets of the first, the powers with their values changed (the default rule below, or the \"gold\" field of the power's template), and no equipment (they go back to the hand, see rules.sockets.onFusion). Then the player picks a reward among cards of rank min(maxRank, level + rewardRankOffset). nameKey: text that names the gold servant ({name}).",
  "count": 3,
  "nameKey": "fusion.goldName",
  "rewardChoice": "fusionReward",
  "rewardRankOffset": 1,
  "defaultGold": {
   "a": {
    "mul": 2
   },
   "h": {
    "mul": 2
   },
   "n": {
    "mul": 2
   }
  }
 },
 "heroActions": {
  "note": "Active powers of the heroes (the \"power\" of a hero card with t = active names one of them). The player arms the button then clicks a servant of one of the zones that passes every test of \"where\". cost: resource, base and step (rules references) and what the step is multiplied by (\"per\": the number of times the hero used it); repeat: usable several times per reinforcement (otherwise once).",
  "grantRebirth": {
   "label": "active.grantRebirth",
   "icon": "medic",
   "color": "#a8d94a",
   "targets": {
    "zones": [
     "board"
    ],
    "where": [
     {
      "companion": false
     },
     {
      "lacksKeyword": "rebirth"
     }
    ]
   },
   "effect": {
    "action": "grantKeywordTemporarily",
    "keyword": "rebirth",
    "log": "log.gainsRebirth"
   }
  },
  "completeFusion": {
   "label": "active.completeFusion",
   "icon": "diplomat",
   "color": "#4f8cff",
   "repeat": true,
   "cost": {
    "resource": "datacrons",
    "base": "game.fusionCost",
    "step": "game.fusionStep",
    "per": "uses"
   },
   "targets": {
    "zones": [
     "board",
     "hand"
    ],
    "where": [
     {
      "copies": 2
     }
    ]
   },
   "effect": {
    "action": "completeFusion",
    "log": "log.createsCopy"
   }
  },
  "triggerBattlecry": {
   "label": "active.triggerBattlecry",
   "icon": "diplomat",
   "color": "#4f8cff",
   "targets": {
    "zones": [
     "board"
    ],
    "where": [
     {
      "hasTrigger": "battlecry"
     }
    ]
   },
   "effect": {
    "action": "replayBattlecry",
    "log": "log.replaysBattlecry"
   }
  }
 },
 "promises": {
  "note": "Cards promised for later. The key is the fx of a hero power: when the event \"on\" (a step event of the flow) happens and a hero has that power, the player chooses one card among \"choose.count\" cards of the category \"choose.category\" and of rank \"choose.rank\" (exactly, if exactRank). The chosen card goes to the zone \"deliver.to\" as soon as \"deliver.spent\" units of the resource \"deliver.resource\" have been spent (it waits for a free slot if the zone is full). texts: the title of the choice ({rank}), the reminder of the delivery ({cost}), and the two log lines ({name}, {cost}).",
  "prophecy": {
   "on": "startMission",
   "choose": {
    "category": "servant",
    "rank": "game.maxRank",
    "exactRank": true,
    "count": "game.fusionRewardProposals"
   },
   "deliver": {
    "resource": "datacrons",
    "spent": "game.prophecyCost",
    "to": "hand"
   },
   "texts": {
    "title": "ui.prophecyChoose",
    "when": "ui.prophecyWhen",
    "discovered": "log.prophecyDiscover",
    "arrived": "log.prophecyArrives"
   }
  }
 },
 "bags": {
  "note": "Bags of values drawn at random. Each bag holds every face \"copies\" times; a draw takes one at random without putting it back, and the bag is refilled when it is empty. The drawn value is added to the resource of \"effect\" (never below \"floor\"; gains count in the statistic of the resource). \"animation\": how the interface shows the draw (diceRoll needs exactly 6 faces). A power template draws from a bag with the action drawBag.",
  "datacube": {
   "faces": [
    -3,
    -1,
    1,
    2,
    2,
    3
   ],
   "copies": 2,
   "effect": {
    "resource": "datacrons",
    "floor": 0
   },
   "animation": "diceRoll"
  }
 },
 "tokens": {
  "note": "Kinds of units that powers summon (they are not cards of the catalogue). A summoned unit carries the id of its kind in its field token, so that powers can select it; its statistics start from the power's values plus the bonus of its carrier (summonA, summonH, from equipment) and the bonus of its side (summonBonus[kind], from powers), which can grow during the game.",
  "drone": {
   "name": "Drone",
   "rank": 1,
   "types": []
  }
 }
